cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it and the Jiang-Kelly-Xiu (2023) paper."
title: "Re-imagining Price-Trend OHLC Representations and Crypto Asset-Class Transfer"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Contributors to Reimaging-Price-Trend-OHLC-Crypto"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kola-official/Reimaging-Price-Trend-OHLC-Crypto"
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-07-24"
abstract: >
  Two empirical packages sharing Jiang-Kelly-Xiu (2023) image-CNN design language:
  (A) US equity daily OHLC representation arms (raw vs volume-/dollar-weighted expand/clip);
  (B) confirmatory crypto spot retrain on Binance USDT with a nine-cell (I,R) out-of-sample audit.
